    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Kind of Game Is It?</h2><br>A roguelike RPG that you can play in 2-3 minutes!<br>You get three randomly dealt cards, but you can only choose one!<br>This game is what happens when you distill the essence of a roguelike RPG!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >User Feedback on SNS!</h2><br>- Quick to play<br>- Can be played in minutes<br>- Simple and fun<br>- Enjoyable rerolling<br>- Time flies by<br>- Makes you want to play repeatedly<br>- Endlessly playable<br>- Challenging<br>- High difficulty but fun<br><br>This is the kind of game it is!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Flow</h2><br>1. Three cards are dealt randomly.<br>2. The player can choose only one of them.<br>3. Defeat monsters to earn gold.<br>4. Use the gold to buy equipment and enhance abilities.<br>5. And then challenge the boss!<br><br>This is the flow of the game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br>- Each challenge lasts only a few minutes, so retries are not too stressful.<br>- Designed with a focus on tempo, making repeated attempts easy.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stages and Modes</h2><br>- There are six different stages in total.<br>- Darkness mode where cards start unidentified.<br>- Time limit mode where the game ends if the time runs out.",
